{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next","id":1419759,"title":"Which books are next?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-23T04:26:52-07:00","id":1419759,"title":"Which books are next?","content":"Lunars is out now, which books are next? When do we get Abyssals, Sidereals, Infernals etc?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T05:37:39-07:00","id":1419770,"title":"","content":"Monday meeting notes has a list of all currently in production books. Next is Exigents as far as splats goes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T05:51:58-07:00","id":1419772,"title":"","content":"Current splat order that we know is Exigents, Sidereals/Getimians, Abyssals/Liminals, Infernals, Alchemicals. Exalted Essence will have enough for all the splats to be playable, but won't be indepth like the splatbooks. Crucible of Legends will have ST-facing info for all the splats.<br /> <br /> Next Exalted book'll probably be Heirs to the Shogunate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T08:30:53-07:00","id":1419792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next?p=1419772#post1419772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next Exalted book'll probably be Heirs to the Shogunate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't imagine it would be anything else. We've sent the <i>Heirs</i> manuscript to layout, and its art notes to the art director.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T08:57:08-07:00","id":1419797,"title":"","content":"Copiled from Monday Meetings and other info about<b></b>:<br /> <br /> <u><b>First Draft</b></u><br /> Exalted Essay Collection<br /> <br /> <u><b>Redlines</b></u><br /> Dragon-Blooded Novella #2<br /> <br /> <u><b>Second Draft</b></u><br /> Exalted Essence<br /> Many-Faced Strangers<br /> <br /> <u><b>Development</b></u><br /> Adversaries of the Righteous<br /> Exigents: Out of the Ashes<br /> Across the Eight Directions<br /> <br /> <u><b>Manuscript Approval</b></u><br /> Crucible of Legends<br /> <br /> <u><b>Post-Approval Development</b></u><br /> Hundred Devils Night Parade<br /> <br /> <u><b>Editing</b></u><br /> Lunar Novella #1<br /> <br /> <u><b>Art Direction</b></u><br /> Heirs to the Shogunate<br /> <br /> <u><b>At Press/Shipment</b></u><br /> Lunars Screen and Booklet<br /> Lunars Map<br /> Lunars Backer Editions<br /> <br /> <u><b>Pitched but Not Confirmed or Cleared</b></u><br /> Sidereals (full title TBA)<br /> Getimians (softcover, full title TBA)<br /> Cults and Spirits book (Title TBA)<br /> Paths of Brigid<br /> Towers of the Mighty<br /> <br /> <u><b>Future Exalt Release Order</b></u><br /> Exigents<br /> Essence (All single book)<br /> Sidereals/Getimians (Separate books)<br /> Abyssals/Liminals (Separate books)<br /> Infernals<br /> Alchemicals<br /> <br /> <u><b>Currently Available</b></u><br /> Exalted Third Edition - PoD and PDF<br /> Exalted Third Edition Screen - PoD and PDF<br /> Dragon-Blooded: What Fire has Wrought - PoD and PDF<br /> Dragon-Blooded Screen - PoD and PDF<br /> Lunars: Fangs at the Gate - PoD and PDF<br /> Lunars Screen - PoD and PDF<br /> Arms of the Chosen - PoD and PDF<br /> Miracles of the Solar Exalted - PoD and PDF<br /> The Realm - PoD and PDF<br /> Tomb of Dreams - PoD and PDF<br /> Adversaries of the Righteous - Monthly material, PDFs<br /> Hundred-Devils Night Parade - Monthly material, PDFs<br /> Circle of Protection - Novella, ebook<br /> False Images - Novella, ebook<br /> The Silence of Our Ancestors - Novella, ebook<br /> Tale of the Visiting Flame - Comic, ebook<br /> Tales from the Age of Sorrows - short stories colleciton, ebook","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T14:56:12-07:00","id":1419849,"title":"","content":"Any word on upcoming kickstarters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T15:09:14-07:00","id":1419852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next?p=1419797#post1419797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Abyssals/Liminals (Separate books)<br /> Infernals</div> </div> </div> </div>Would a reasonable guess be something like:<br /> <br /> Abyssals 2023?<br /> Infernals 2024?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T15:46:46-07:00","id":1419858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NineDaysDead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next?p=1419852#post1419852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would a reasonable guess be something like:<br /> Abyssals 2023?<br /> Infernals 2024?</div> </div> </div> </div>The plan appears to be one &quot;main&quot; splat per year (Getiminans and Liminals don't count as &quot;main&quot;, and will come out in the same year as another splat). Exigents is supposed to get a Kickstarter probably around the start of next year, 2021, and come out the year after that, 2022. Sidereals would then get Kickstartered in 2022 and come out in 2023, Abyssals would get a KS campaign in 2023 and come out in 2024, Infernals would be 2024 and 2025, and finally Alchemicals in 2025 and 2026.<br /> <br /> Of course, all of that assumes that the schedule doesn't slip, which we know is definitely possible - Exigents, for example, was originally hoped for this year, but covid and other problems caused that to be delayed. And something like that could always happen to other books too, and would likely push everything back. So those numbers are more of a &quot;if all goes well, in the best case scenario&quot;, rather than a firm timeline. Certainly Onyx Path won't commit to anything that firm this far out, since doing so only invites disappointment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T16:34:30-07:00","id":1419862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next?p=1419849#post1419849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any word on upcoming kickstarters?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the next Exalted Kickstarter will be Exigents. As for When... Heck if I know. Maybe next year? It was supposed to be THIS year but Covid happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T16:39:53-07:00","id":1419863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419759-which-books-are-next?p=1419862#post1419862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the next Exalted Kickstarter will be Exigents. As for When... Heck if I know. Maybe next year?</div> </div> </div> </div>According to Rich Thomas (in a comment on <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/aint-afraid-of-no-ghosts-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">last week's Monday Meeting Notes</a>), Exigents will be &quot;Next year, as early as we can do it.&quot; Hopefully that means January, but could of course always be later than that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}